# CLI Reference

This page is generated from the Rust command declarations under `crates/loom-cli*`.

## High-value workflows

### Thread lifecycle

```bash
loom
loom list
loom resume [thread-id]
loom private
loom share [thread-id] --visibility organization|private|public
loom share [thread-id] --support
loom search "query"
```

### Remote execution and connectivity

```bash
loom weaver ps
loom weaver new --image IMAGE --repo URL --branch BRANCH
loom weaver attach <weaver-id>
loom ssh <weaver-id>
loom tunnel up --weaver <weaver-id>
loom wg devices list
```

### Operational observability commands

```bash
loom crash projects --org <org-id>
loom crons monitors --org <org-id>
loom sessions list --project <project-id>
```

